  "facts": [
    {
      "id": "new-picker-instant",
      "fact": "Scheduled Date & Time in the new-call form is a device-local calendar/24-hour clock picker. Done commits datetime as Date.toISOString(); Cancel discards draft selection. New-call submit normalizes to UTC and sends DispatchOnUtc only for a non-pending call with a picked time.",
