    {
      "id": "new-lead-time",
      "fact": "New-call UI rejects a picked non-pending instant less than15minutes ahead, including past values. Exact15minutes is the mathematical threshold (< check); elapsed submission time still counts. The dedicated reschedule sheet and its API do not run this client helper.",
      "learner_wording": "For a scheduled call, choose a time at least fifteen minutes ahead. Leave scheduling blank only when immediate dispatch is allowed by the department’s field requirements.",
