    {
      "id": "pending-is-separate",
      "fact": "New Call hides scheduling while Save as pending is on. Pending omits DispatchOnUtc; client and Core skip DispatchOn/DispatchList required-field rules for Pending. Core ignores a supplied schedule on new pending calls. Pending is State8; scheduled is Active State0 with a future UTC dispatch instant and HasBeenDispatched false. Existing Pending can separately become scheduled through EditCall with a future dispatch instant; not exercised by the current scenario.",
      "learner_wording": "Keep Save as pending off for this scheduled example. Pending is a separate queue for a dispatcher to release manually.",
