    {
      "id": "department-display",
      "fact": "Core preserves DispatchOnUtc as the UTC instant; legacy DispatchOn is department-local input. ConvertCall returns both UTC DispatchedOnUtc and department-converted DispatchedOn using the controller TimeZone claim; that claim is supplied from department.TimeZone. TimeConverter returns a zone-less department wall-clock value. Scheduled table and detail prefer server department-local DispatchedOn and parse its numeric components into a local Date to preserve the shown wall clock when formatting.",
      "learner_wording": "After saving, verify Scheduled For on the numbered call. This view shows the department’s time, which can differ from the time shown in the device picker.",
